{"seq":1,"slug":"capability-thresholds-triggers","title":"能力阈值与触发条件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/frontier-safety-frameworks/core-mechanisms/capability-thresholds-triggers","wordCount":2086,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"能力阈值与触发条件\">能力阈值与触发条件</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>阈值是整套框架里最容易被简化、也最需要精确定义的部件。拆开来它有六个彼此依赖的概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>指标</strong>：度量哪一类危险能力的评测套件与任务集，例如生物序列设计的操作难度或自主研究任务的完成度。</li>\n<li><strong>估计器</strong>：把评测结果映射为能力判断的推断过程，输出的估计量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{c}(m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，与被测模型的不可观测真值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c^{*}(m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 相区分。</li>\n<li><strong>裁决规则</strong>：证据充分性不足时往哪边倒的判据；灾难性场景下默认按已越界处理。</li>\n<li><strong>触发后果</strong>：越过阈值后绑定的保障集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，没有后果的阈值只是口号。</li>\n<li><strong>诱导鸿沟</strong>：潜在能力与当前提示、脚手架下可诱导表现之间的差，决定漏报风险的下限。</li>\n<li><strong>模糊区</strong>：证据既不足以断言越过、也不足以断言未越过的中间地带，是裁决规则真正承压的地方。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>常见误解有二。其一，把阈值当成一个数值——容量化的真值不可直接观测，框架实际操作的永远是一个带误差的估计量，因此阈值本质是统计判定而非开关。其二，以为「本次没测出来」等于「能力不存在」——由于诱导鸿沟，评测低分什么都不证明，评测高分才能下界性地确认能力存在。这两点合起来解释了为什么预注册、留痕与独立裁决会成为跨框架共识：它们都是对「估计量不可尽信」这一事实的制度补偿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阈值不是一条线-而是一个判定系统\">阈值不是一条线，而是一个判定系统</h2><p>把阈值理解成「能力超过某个数就报警」，是读框架文档最容易犯的简化错误。一个能运转的阈值实际上由四个部件组成：<strong>指标</strong>（用什么评测套件度量什么能力）、<strong>估计器</strong>（从评测结果到能力判断的推断过程）、<strong>裁决规则</strong>（证据不足时往哪边倒）、<strong>触发后果</strong>（触发后绑定哪套保障）。四者缺一不可——没有指标的阈值是口号，没有裁决规则的阈值会在第一次争议中崩溃，没有后果的阈值干脆不是承诺。以 Anthropic 的条件结构为例，模型的能力真值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c^{*}(m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 不可直接观测，框架实际操作的是评测产出的估计量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{c}(m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，而触发的完整形式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>且裁决规则判定证据充分</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>启用保障 </mtext><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{c}(m) \\geq \\theta,\\;\\text{且裁决规则判定证据充分} \\;\\Rightarrow\\; \\text{启用保障 } S(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">且裁决规则判定证据充分</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">启用保障</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个形式化立刻暴露出一个别处不存在的难题：普通工程系统的阈值作用于可直接测量的物理量，而这里的阈值作用于一个依赖评测质量的代理变量。整个前沿安全治理的可信度，都押在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{c}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c^{*}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的逼近程度上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"诱导鸿沟-测不出不等于没有\">诱导鸿沟：测不出不等于没有</h2><p>逼近程度的最大敌人叫<strong>诱导鸿沟</strong>：模型潜在具备的能力与当前提示词和脚手架下能诱导出的表现之间的差。同一批权重，换上多轮提示工程、外部工具调用、针对性微调或更长的思考预算，评测分数可以显著抬升。这意味着任何一次评估都只是对能力分布下界的一次抽样——评出高分说明能力确实在（下界成立），评不出高分却什么都不能证明。Anthropic 在 RSP v3 公告里承认了这一点的严重性：排除 Claude Opus 4.6 未越过 AI R&amp;D 阈值的判定，「需要比我们希望的更主观的评估」（<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/responsible-scaling-policy-v3\">https://www.anthropic.com/news/responsible-scaling-policy-v3</a> ）。行业为此发展出一套补偿手段：用标准化的诱导增强技术（多次采样、最佳选优、脚手架自动化）压缩鸿沟；在报告里同时给出原始分数与增强后分数；把「评估后发现的遗漏诱导方式」写进事后复盘。但补偿只能缩小、不能消除鸿沟，这是所有阈值体系的地基性限制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  D[&quot;阈值定义&lt;br/&gt;能力域 + 危险水平&quot;] --&gt; P[&quot;预注册评测套件&lt;br/&gt;指标 + 诱导协议&quot;]&#10;  P --&gt; R[&quot;训练期间定期运行&quot;]&#10;  R --&gt; A{&quot;裁决&lt;br/&gt;是否越过 θ ?&quot;}&#10;  A -- 明确越过 --&gt; T[&quot;触发保障升级&quot;]&#10;  A -- 模糊区 --&gt; Z[&quot;预防性处理&lt;br/&gt;按越过分歧情形对待&quot;]&#10;  A -- 明确未越 --&gt; K[&quot;继续监测&quot;]&#10;  T --&gt; C[&quot;事后校准&lt;br/&gt;复盘误报/漏报&quot;]&#10;  Z --&gt; C\">graph TD\n  D[\"阈值定义&lt;br/&gt;能力域 + 危险水平\"] --&gt; P[\"预注册评测套件&lt;br/&gt;指标 + 诱导协议\"]\n  P --&gt; R[\"训练期间定期运行\"]\n  R --&gt; A{\"裁决&lt;br/&gt;是否越过 θ ?\"}\n  A -- 明确越过 --&gt; T[\"触发保障升级\"]\n  A -- 模糊区 --&gt; Z[\"预防性处理&lt;br/&gt;按越过分歧情形对待\"]\n  A -- 明确未越 --&gt; K[\"继续监测\"]\n  T --&gt; C[\"事后校准&lt;br/&gt;复盘误报/漏报\"]\n  Z --&gt; C</pre><h2 id=\"模糊区与预防性升级\">模糊区与预防性升级</h2><p>裁决规则的难点集中在模糊区：证据既不足以断言越过、也不足以断言未越过。Anthropic 给出的生物学案例很有代表性——模型已经能通过大多数快速评测，因此不能再声称风险低；但这些测试又不足以论证风险高；补充湿实验室试验的尝试也因周期太长而滞后于模型迭代（RSP v3 公告）。模糊区里怎么裁，本质上是一个不对称代价下的决策问题：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>FN</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>∣</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>≥</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>FP</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>≥</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>∣</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L} = C_{\\text{FN}}\\cdot P(\\hat{c}&lt;\\theta \\mid c^{*}\\geq\\theta) + C_{\\text{FP}}\\cdot P(\\hat{c}\\geq\\theta \\mid c^{*}&lt;\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">FN</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8747em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">FP</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>灾难性风险场景中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>FN</mtext></msub><mo>≫</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>FP</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{FN}} \\gg C_{\\text{FP}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">FN</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">FP</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——漏掉一次真实越线的代价是灾难级的，误报的代价只是额外的安全开支与一些使用摩擦。所以各家框架在模糊区的选择高度一致：按已越过处理，先上保障再说，即所谓预防性升级。GDM 把同样的逻辑前移成了「早期预警」——不等模型到达 CCL，逼近就行动；Anthropic v2.1 则补了一条程序性承诺：每次升级保障等级时重估所有阈值的设定，避免旧阈值在新保障下失去意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨框架的阈值形态对比\">跨框架的阈值形态对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架</th>\n<th>阈值载体</th>\n<th>典型条目</th>\n<th>模糊区策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Anthropic RSP</td>\n<td>命名式能力阈值</td>\n<td>CBRN 助长（ASL-3）；AI R&amp;D 两级拆分（全自动化入门级研究 / 显著加速扩展）</td>\n<td>预防性升级 + 保障升级时重估阈值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OpenAI 准备度</td>\n<td>类别内风险评分</td>\n<td>网络安全、CBRN、说服、自主性各设 low–crit 四档</td>\n<td>high 即红线，评分保守侧倾斜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GDM FSF</td>\n<td>关键能力级别 CCL</td>\n<td>自主性、生物安全、网络安全、ML R&amp;D，2026 年新增有害操纵</td>\n<td>早期预警余量 + 安全案例评审</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三种形态共享同一个生命周期（见上图）：定义、预注册、运行、裁决、触发、校准。差异在于颗粒度——RSP 的阈值数量少而重，每条都绑定整套 ASL 标准；准备度的评分多而轻，靠类别覆盖面换取灵敏度；CCL 介于两者之间，随风险研究逐个增补。颗粒度选择的背后是各自对失效模式的判断：怕漏报的做密，怕误伤的做疏，怕单点失灵的两边都留冗余。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从判定到证据链-阈值的工程原则\">从判定到证据链：阈值的工程原则</h2><p>让阈值在组织内部真正有约束力，靠的是几条从高可靠性行业借来的纪律。第一，预注册：评测套件、诱导协议和裁决规则在训练开始前定稿存档，防止事后挑对自己有利的口径——这是 safety case 方法论的核心动作，Anthropic v2 公开声明借鉴之。第二，留痕：每次判定的证据、分歧和不确定性都要写成可审计的文档，2026 年起 Anthropic 的做法是把整份分析放进公开的风险报告并标注删节位置。第三，独立裁决：判定权不能完全落在业务团队手里，<a href=\"../landscape/anthropic-asl\">Anthropic 的负责任扩展官与 LTBT 制衡设计</a>以及 <a href=\"third-party-evaluations\">第三方评估接口</a>都是给判定加独立性权重的尝试。第四，承认极限：把「哪些情况我们判不了」写进结论而不是藏起来——Opus 4.6 判定附带的困难声明之所以重要，是因为它为下一次模糊区裁决提供了校准基准。这些原则执行得好坏，正是<a href=\"../critiques-practice/framework-critiques\">对框架的批评</a>最集中的火力点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>阈值的本质是一个带不确定性的统计判定系统，而非一条线。它的三个结构性弱点——诱导鸿沟、模糊区、代理变量的评测依赖——决定了框架治理的天花板，也解释了为什么预防性升级、预注册与独立裁决会成为跨框架共识。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"能力阈值与触发条件","id":"能力阈值与触发条件"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"阈值不是一条线，而是一个判定系统","id":"阈值不是一条线-而是一个判定系统"},{"level":2,"text":"诱导鸿沟：测不出不等于没有","id":"诱导鸿沟-测不出不等于没有"},{"level":2,"text":"模糊区与预防性升级","id":"模糊区与预防性升级"},{"level":2,"text":"跨框架的阈值形态对比","id":"跨框架的阈值形态对比"},{"level":2,"text":"从判定到证据链：阈值的工程原则","id":"从判定到证据链-阈值的工程原则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"OpenAI 准备度框架与 Google DeepMind 前沿安全框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/frontier-safety-frameworks/landscape/openai-googlemind-frameworks"},"next":{"title":"安全标准：权重保护与内部部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/frontier-safety-frameworks/core-mechanisms/security-standards"}}